# 《미방송분》 Saeneoul relocation village alley (B zone, 1-04/1-05): cement-block walls, slate roofs,
# plastered house walls, windows, a door, an iron gate, the flyer and pole sticker, a crock and a step.
# Swap with linear.pal / hifi.pal like the shore tiles. Multi-tile pieces are <name>_<col>_<row>.
@palette ../../../art/palette/night-school.pal
@size 16 16
@output ../tiles/mbs_tiles_village.png
@preview ../previews/mbs_tiles_village_x4.png 4
@columns 8

